This project is an integration layer. It contains no code from the projects
below, but it is designed against their public interfaces and owes them the
ideas it is built on:

  - NousResearch/hermes-agent (MIT) — the agent, and the public subagent
    lifecycle API that makes per-desk models possible without a fork.
  - teknium1/hermes-pixel-office — the hook -> event log -> canvas shape.
  - aiunlocked1412/hermes-agent-pixel — the server-discovery and
    fire-and-forget relay pattern used by the plugin sink.
